{
  "bookId": "hero-215201",
  "id": "bond-29305",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29305001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "深更半夜的……主公带我来这里，是要给我惊喜吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就知道瞒不过你，来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是我为你准备的观星楼，配置了最新的天文望远镜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "夜晚的时候，你就可以更好地观测天象了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "主公……你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么？天文望远镜也被你猜到了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "没有，这还是第一次有人，超出了我的预料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "我以为，你会送我一大片菜地……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那也太辛苦你和周瑜了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "哈哈，主公说笑了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "不过，如果真的是菜地，我一定不会让周瑜打扰主公的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，这个可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "哈哈哈，主公，我看了一下，今天有流星雨。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "无论你许什么样的愿望……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29305015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "我都会帮你实现它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
